# Text files are checked out with LF on every system. Windows' default (CRLF) made the checked-in .tdl files differ from what the converter writes, and failed the
# tests that compare them (tests/test_tdl_shipped*.py). A test that wants CRLF writes it itself.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.svgz binary
